cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this work, cite it using the metadata below.
title: >-
  Collapse-Hawking Bridge: a dimensionless mapping from critical
  gravitational collapse to black-hole thermodynamics
authors:
  - family-names: Isaev
    given-names: Ishak Khamzatovich
    affiliation: Independent researcher, Nalchik, Kabardino-Balkarian Republic, Russian Federation
version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-11
keywords:
  - critical gravitational collapse
  - Choptuik scaling
  - black-hole thermodynamics
  - Hawking radiation
  - Page curve
  - double-null evolution
  - scale ladder
license-url: https://github.com/wild8highlander/choptuik_ac_bc/blob/main/LICENSE
abstract: >-
  A self-contained research package connecting the threshold of black-hole
  formation (critical collapse of a massless scalar field, double-null
  characteristic engine) to semiclassical black-hole thermodynamics. The
  dimensionless born spectrum f~(eps) measured by the engine is mapped onto
  physical black holes through a single input mass scale; the package ships
  the A* grid-honesty ladder, the master bridge table, Page-curve ensembles,
  scale ladders and the Delta*gamma ~ 1.27 invariant check (campaign C3).
